+++ b/docs/options.md
@@ -17,6 +17,12 @@ Useful and often used kwargs are:
 - `required`: Makes option required.
 - `type`: Sets {ref}`parameter type <parameter-types>`
 
+An option can also receive a sequence of `validators`. Each callable
+receives the context, option, and converted value. They run in declared
+order after the option callback, and each return value is passed to the
+next validator.
+`None` or an empty sequence disables validation.
+
